 "summary": "A single super-red InGaAlP LED die on a 1.6 x 0.8 mm (0603) board-substrate package with a colourless diffused resin top. Dominant wavelength is 633 nm typical (627 to 639 nm) and forward voltage 2.00 V typical at 20 mA, with a 25 mA continuous rating at 25 °C. LS Q976-NR-1 is delivered from brightness groups N to R, 28 to 180 mcd at 20 mA. Listed uses are electronic equipment, white goods and gaming or amusement machines.",
